msgstr "Une description lisible du lieu de l'événement."

#. Description of the 'Types' (JSON) field in DocType 'Quota'
#: suite/mail/doctype/quota/quota.json
msgid ""
"A list of all the type names as defined in the \"JMAP Types Names\" registry"
" (e.g., Email, Calendar, etc.) to which this quota applies."
msgstr ""
"Une liste de tous les noms de types définis dans le registre « JMAP Types "
"Names » (par ex. Email, Calendrier, etc.) auxquels ce quota s'applique."

#. Description of the 'Types' (JSON) field in DocType 'Push Subscription'
#: suite/mail/doctype/push_subscription/push_subscription.json
msgid ""
"A list of types the client is interested in. A `StateChange` notification "
"will only be sent if the data for one of these types changes."
msgstr ""
"Une liste des types auxquels le client s'intéresse. Une notification "
"`StateChange` ne sera envoyée que si les données de l'un de ces types "
"changent."

#. Description of the 'Sequence' (Int) field in DocType 'Calendar Event'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_event/calendar_event.json
msgid ""
"A monotonically increasing number representing the version of the event."
msgstr ""
"Un nombre strictement croissant représentant la version de l'événement."

#. Description of the 'Event Patch' (JSON) field in DocType 'Event
#. Notification'
#: suite/mail/doctype/event_notification/event_notification.json
msgid ""
"A patch encoding the change between the data in the event property, and the "
"data after the update."
msgstr ""
"Un correctif encodant la différence entre les données de la propriété de "
"l'événement et les données après la mise à jour."

#. Description of the 'Key Prefix' (Data) field in DocType 'Mail Cluster
#. Store'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mail_cluster_store/mail_cluster_store.json
