msgid "The id of the Mailbox."
msgstr "L'ID de la boîte aux lettres."

#. Description of the 'ID' (Data) field in DocType 'Participant Identity'
#: suite/mail/doctype/participant_identity/participant_identity.json
msgid "The id of the Participant Identity."
msgstr "L'ID de l'identité du participant."

#. Description of the 'Duration' (Data) field in DocType 'Calendar Event'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_event/calendar_event.json
msgid "The length of the event expressed as a duration (e.g., PT30M, P1D)."
msgstr ""
"La durée de l'événement exprimée sous forme de durée (par ex. PT30M, P1D)."

#. Description of the 'Calendar Event' (Link) field in DocType 'Event
#. Notification'
#: suite/mail/doctype/event_notification/event_notification.json
msgid "The link to the CalendarEvent that this notification is about."
msgstr ""
"Le lien vers l'événement de calendrier concerné par cette notification."

#. Description of the 'Cluster' (Link) field in DocType 'Mail Server'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mail_server/mail_server.json
msgid "The mail cluster this server belongs to."
msgstr "Le cluster de messagerie auquel appartient ce serveur."

#. Description of the 'Max Retries' (Int) field in DocType 'Mail Cluster
#. Store'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mail_cluster_store/mail_cluster_store.json
msgid ""
"The maximum number of times to retry failed requests. Set to 0 to disable "
"retries."
msgstr ""
"Le nombre maximal de tentatives pour les requêtes échouées. Définir à 0 pour"
" désactiver les nouvelles tentatives."

#. Description of the 'Content Type' (Data) field in DocType 'Event Link'
#: suite/mail/doctype/event_link/event_link.json
msgid "The media type describing the linked resource."
msgstr "Le type de média décrivant la ressource liée."

#: suite/mail/api/spamd.py:18 suite/mail/api/spamd.py:36
msgid "The message is required."
msgstr "Le message est requis."

#: suite/mail/doctype/rate_limit/rate_limit.py:31
msgid ""
"The method {method} is missing the required {decorator} decorator. Please "
"add it to enforce dynamic rate limiting."
msgstr ""
"La méthode {method} ne comporte pas le décorateur {decorator} requis. "
"Veuillez l'ajouter pour appliquer la limitation dynamique du débit."

#. Description of the 'Container' (Data) field in DocType 'Mail Cluster Store'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mail_cluster_store/mail_cluster_store.json
msgid "The name of the container in the Storage Account."
msgstr "Le nom du conteneur dans le compte de stockage."

#. Description of the 'Name' (Data) field in DocType 'Event Notification'
#: suite/mail/doctype/event_notification/event_notification.json
msgid "The name of the person who made the change."
msgstr "Le nom de la personne ayant effectué la modification."

#. Description of the 'Name' (Data) field in DocType 'Quota'
#: suite/mail/doctype/quota/quota.json
msgid "The name of the quota object."
msgstr "Le nom de l'objet quota."

#. Description of the 'Unread Emails' (Int) field in DocType 'Mailbox'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mailbox/mailbox.json
msgid ""
"The number of Emails in this Mailbox that have neither the `$seen` keyword "
"nor the `$draft` keyword."
msgstr ""
"Le nombre d'e-mails de cette boîte aux lettres ne comportant ni le mot-clé "
"`$seen` ni le mot-clé `$draft`."

#. Description of the 'Total Emails' (Int) field in DocType 'Mailbox'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mailbox/mailbox.json
msgid "The number of Emails in this Mailbox."
msgstr "Le nombre d'e-mails dans cette boîte aux lettres."

#. Description of the 'Total Threads' (Int) field in DocType 'Mailbox'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mailbox/mailbox.json
msgid ""
"The number of Threads where at least one Email in the Thread is in this "
"Mailbox."
msgstr ""
"Le nombre de conversations dont au moins un e-mail se trouve dans cette "
"boîte aux lettres."

#. Description of the 'Status' (Select) field in DocType 'Calendar Event'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_event/calendar_event.json
msgid "The overall status of the event."
msgstr "Le statut global de l'événement."

#. Description of the 'Status' (Select) field in DocType 'Event Participant'
#: suite/mail/doctype/event_participant/event_participant.json
msgid "The participant’s current participation status."
msgstr "Le statut de participation actuel du participant."

#. Description of the 'Participants' (Table) field in DocType 'Calendar Event'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_event/calendar_event.json
msgid "The people or entities involved in the event."
msgstr "Les personnes ou entités impliquées dans l'événement."

#. Description of the 'Locations' (Table) field in DocType 'Calendar Event'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_event/calendar_event.json
msgid "The physical or virtual locations where the event takes place."
msgstr "Les lieux physiques ou virtuels où se déroule l'événement."

#. Description of the 'Text' (Code) field in DocType 'Vacation Response'
#: suite/mail/doctype/vacation_response/vacation_response.json
msgid ""
"The plaintext body to send in response to messages when the vacation "
"response is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Le corps en texte brut à envoyer en réponse aux messages lorsque la réponse "
"d'absence est activée."

#. Description of the 'May Write All' (Check) field in DocType 'Calendar
#. Rights'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_rights/calendar_rights.json
msgid ""
"The principal may create, modify or destroy all events in this calendar, or "
"move events to or from this calendar."
msgstr ""
"Le principal peut créer, modifier ou supprimer tous les événements de ce "
"calendrier, ou déplacer des événements vers ou depuis ce calendrier."

#. Description of the 'May Write Own' (Check) field in DocType 'Calendar
#. Rights'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_rights/calendar_rights.json
msgid ""
"The principal may create, modify or destroy an event on this calendar if "
"either they are the owner of the event or the event has no owner."
msgstr ""
"Le principal peut créer, modifier ou supprimer un événement de ce calendrier"
" s'il en est le propriétaire ou si l'événement n'a pas de propriétaire."

#. Description of the 'May Delete' (Check) field in DocType 'Calendar Rights'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_rights/calendar_rights.json
msgid "The principal may delete the calendar itself."
msgstr "Le principal peut supprimer le calendrier lui-même."

#. Description of the 'May Read Items' (Check) field in DocType 'Calendar
#. Rights'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_rights/calendar_rights.json
msgid "The principal may fetch the events in this calendar."
msgstr "Le principal peut récupérer les événements de ce calendrier."

#. Description of the 'May Update Private' (Check) field in DocType 'Calendar
#. Rights'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_rights/calendar_rights.json
msgid ""
"The principal may modify per-user properties on all events in the calendar."
msgstr ""
"Le principal peut modifier les propriétés propres à l'utilisateur sur tous "
"les événements du calendrier."

#. Description of the 'May Admin' (Check) field in DocType 'Calendar Rights'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_rights/calendar_rights.json
msgid "The principal may modify the \"shareWith\" property for this calendar."
msgstr ""
"Le principal peut modifier la propriété « shareWith » de ce calendrier."

#. Description of the 'May RSVP' (Check) field in DocType 'Calendar Rights'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_rights/calendar_rights.json
msgid ""
"The principal may modify the properties of any Participant object that "
"corresponds to one of the user's Participant Identity objects in the "
"account."
msgstr ""
"Le principal peut modifier les propriétés de tout objet Participant "
"correspondant à l'un des objets Identité de participant de l'utilisateur "
"dans le compte."

#. Description of the 'May Read Free Busy' (Check) field in DocType 'Calendar
#. Rights'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_rights/calendar_rights.json
msgid ""
"The principal may read the free-busy information for this calendar as part "
"of a call to `Principal/getAvailability`."
msgstr ""
"Le principal peut lire les informations de disponibilité de ce calendrier "
"dans le cadre d'un appel à `Principal/getAvailability`."

#. Description of the 'Share With' (Table) field in DocType 'Calendar'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar/calendar.json
msgid ""
"The principals this calendar is shared with, and the access rights granted "
"to each."
msgstr ""
"Les principaux avec lesquels ce calendrier est partagé, ainsi que les droits"
" d'accès accordés à chacun."

#: suite/mail/api/outbound.py:167 suite/mail/api/outbound.py:245
msgid "The raw message exceeds the maximum allowed size of {0} MB."
msgstr "Le message brut dépasse la taille maximale autorisée de {0} Mo."

#: suite/mail/api/outbound.py:162 suite/mail/api/outbound.py:297
msgid "The raw message is required."
msgstr "Le message brut est requis."

#. Description of the 'Resource Type' (Data) field in DocType 'Quota'
#: suite/mail/doctype/quota/quota.json
msgid "The resource type of the quota as defined in `#resourcetype`."
msgstr "Le type de ressource du quota tel que défini dans `#resourcetype`."

#. Description of the 'Schedule ID' (Data) field in DocType 'Event
#. Notification'
#: suite/mail/doctype/event_notification/event_notification.json
msgid "The scheduleId URI of the person who made the change, if any."
msgstr ""
"L'URI scheduleId de la personne ayant effectué la modification, le cas "
"échéant."

#. Description of the 'Schedule ID' (Data) field in DocType 'Event
#. Participant'
#: suite/mail/doctype/event_participant/event_participant.json
msgid ""
"The scheduling identifier used to uniquely identify this participant in "
"scheduling messages."
msgstr ""
"L'identifiant de planification utilisé pour identifier de façon unique ce "
"participant dans les messages de planification."

#. Description of the 'Email or Domain' (Data) field in DocType 'Screened
#. Email
#. Address'
#: suite/mail/doctype/screened_email_address/screened_email_address.json
msgid ""
"The screened sender: either an email address (john@example.com) or a domain "
"prefixed with @ (@example.com), which applies to every sender from that "
"domain."
msgstr ""
"L'expéditeur filtré : soit une adresse e-mail (john@example.com), soit un "
"domaine précédé de @ (@example.com), qui s'applique à tout expéditeur de ce "
"domaine."

#. Description of the 'Secret Key' (Password) field in DocType 'Mail Cluster
#. Store'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mail_cluster_store/mail_cluster_store.json
msgid "The secret key for the S3 account."
msgstr "La clé secrète du compte S3."

#. Description of the 'Calendar Event ID' (Data) field in DocType 'Calendar
#. Event'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_event/calendar_event.json
msgid "The server-assigned unique identifier of the event."
msgstr "L'identifiant unique de l'événement attribué par le serveur."

#. Description of the 'DNS Provider' (Select) field in DocType 'Mail Settings'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mail_settings/mail_settings.json
msgid "The service provider managing your root domain's DNS records."
msgstr ""
"Le fournisseur de services gérant les enregistrements DNS de votre domaine "
"racine."

#. Description of the 'Address Books' (Table) field in DocType 'Contact Card'
#: suite/mail/doctype/contact_card/contact_card.json
msgid ""
"The set of Address Book IDs this Contact Card belongs to. A card must belong"
" to at least one Address Book at all times (until it is destroyed)."
msgstr ""
"L'ensemble des identifiants de carnets d'adresses auxquels appartient cette "
"fiche de contact. Une fiche doit appartenir à au moins un carnet d'adresses "
"en permanence (jusqu'à sa suppression)."

#. Description of the 'Account' (Link) field in DocType 'Mailbox Settings'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mailbox_settings/mailbox_settings.json
msgid ""
"The shared JMAP account ID these mailbox settings belong to. They are the "
"same for everyone with access to the account."
msgstr ""
"L'identifiant du compte JMAP partagé auquel appartiennent ces paramètres de "
"boîte aux lettres. Ils sont identiques pour toute personne ayant accès au "
"compte."

#. Description of the 'Account' (Link) field in DocType 'Screened Email
#. Address'
#: suite/mail/doctype/screened_email_address/screened_email_address.json
msgid ""
"The shared JMAP account this screened email belongs to. The screened list is"
" the same for everyone with access to the account."
msgstr ""
"Le compte JMAP partagé auquel appartient cet e-mail filtré. La liste de "
"filtrage est identique pour toute personne ayant accès au compte."

#. Description of the 'Account' (Link) field in DocType 'Mail Sync History'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mail_sync_history/mail_sync_history.json
msgid ""
"The shared JMAP account this sync watermark belongs to. It is the same for "
"everyone with access to the account."
msgstr ""
"Le compte JMAP partagé auquel appartient ce repère de synchronisation. Il "
"est identique pour toute personne ayant accès au compte."

#. Description of the 'Soft Limit' (Int) field in DocType 'Quota'
#: suite/mail/doctype/quota/quota.json
msgid "The soft limit set by this quota object."
msgstr "La limite souple définie par cet objet de quota."

#. Description of the 'Start' (Data) field in DocType 'Calendar Event'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_event/calendar_event.json
msgid "The start date-time of the event."
msgstr "La date et l'heure de début de l'événement."

#. Description of the 'Subject' (Data) field in DocType 'Vacation Response'
#: suite/mail/doctype/vacation_response/vacation_response.json
msgid ""
"The subject that will be used by the message sent in response to messages "
"when the vacation response is enabled."
msgstr ""
"L'objet utilisé par le message envoyé en réponse aux messages lorsque la "
"réponse d'absence est activée."

#. Description of the 'Offset' (Data) field in DocType 'Event Alert'
#: suite/mail/doctype/event_alert/event_alert.json
msgid "The time offset relative to the event start or end."
msgstr "Le décalage horaire par rapport au début ou à la fin de l'événement."

#. Description of the 'Created (UTC)' (Data) field in DocType 'Event
#. Notification'
#: suite/mail/doctype/event_notification/event_notification.json
msgid "The time this notification was created."
msgstr "L'heure à laquelle cette notification a été créée."

#. Description of the 'Expires' (Datetime) field in DocType 'Push
#. Subscription'
#: suite/mail/doctype/push_subscription/push_subscription.json
msgid "The time this push subscription expires."
msgstr "L'heure à laquelle cet abonnement push expire."

#. Description of the 'Time Zone' (Autocomplete) field in DocType 'Calendar
#. Event'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_event/calendar_event.json
msgid "The time zone in which the event start time is defined."
msgstr ""
"Le fuseau horaire dans lequel l'heure de début de l'événement est définie."

#. Description of the 'Time Zone' (Autocomplete) field in DocType 'Calendar'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar/calendar.json
msgid "The time zone to use for events without a time zone."
msgstr "Le fuseau horaire à utiliser pour les événements sans fuseau horaire."

#. Description of the 'Token' (Password) field in DocType 'Mail Settings'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mail_settings/mail_settings.json
msgid "The token used to authenticate with your DNS provider."
msgstr "Le jeton utilisé pour s'authentifier auprès de votre fournisseur DNS."

#. Description of the 'Kind' (Select) field in DocType 'Event Participant'
#: suite/mail/doctype/event_participant/event_participant.json
msgid "The type of participant."
msgstr "Le type de participant."

#. Description of the 'Quota ID' (Data) field in DocType 'Quota'
#: suite/mail/doctype/quota/quota.json
msgid "The unique identifier for this quota."
msgstr "L'identifiant unique de ce quota."

#. Description of the 'Principal ID' (Data) field in DocType 'Calendar Rights'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_rights/calendar_rights.json
msgid ""
"The unique identifier of a principal (user, group, or resource) to grant "
"access to this calendar."
msgstr ""
"L'identifiant unique d'un principal (utilisateur, groupe ou ressource) "
"auquel accorder l'accès à ce calendrier."

#. Description of the 'Calendar ID' (Data) field in DocType 'Event Calendar'
#: suite/mail/doctype/event_calendar/event_calendar.json
msgid "The unique identifier of the calendar in which the event is stored."
msgstr ""
"L'identifiant unique du calendrier dans lequel l'événement est stocké."

#. Description of the 'May Add Items' (Check) field in DocType 'Mailbox'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mailbox/mailbox.json
msgid ""
"The user may add mail to this Mailbox (by either creating a new Email or "
"moving an existing one)."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur peut ajouter du courrier à cette boîte aux lettres (en créant "
"un nouvel e-mail ou en déplaçant un e-mail existant)."

#. Description of the 'May Set Keywords' (Check) field in DocType 'Mailbox'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mailbox/mailbox.json
msgid ""
"The user may add or remove any keyword other than `$seen` to/from an Email."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur peut ajouter ou retirer tout mot-clé autre que `$seen` à un "
"e-mail."

#. Description of the 'May Set Seen' (Check) field in DocType 'Mailbox'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mailbox/mailbox.json
msgid "The user may add or remove the `$seen` keyword to/from an Email."
msgstr "L'utilisateur peut ajouter ou retirer le mot-clé `$seen` à un e-mail."

#. Description of the 'May Create Child' (Check) field in DocType 'Mailbox'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mailbox/mailbox.json
msgid "The user may create a Mailbox with this Mailbox as its parent."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur peut créer une boîte aux lettres ayant cette boîte aux lettres"
" comme parent."

#. Description of the 'May Write' (Check) field in DocType 'Address Book'
#: suite/mail/doctype/address_book/address_book.json
msgid ""
"The user may create, modify or destroy all Contact Cards in this Address "
"Book, or move them to or from this Address Book."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur peut créer, modifier ou supprimer toutes les fiches de contact"
" de ce carnet d'adresses, ou les déplacer vers ou depuis ce carnet "
"d'adresses."

#. Description of the 'May Write All' (Check) field in DocType 'Calendar'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar/calendar.json
msgid ""
"The user may create, modify or destroy all events in this calendar, or move "
"events to or from this calendar."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur peut créer, modifier ou supprimer tous les événements de ce "
"calendrier, ou déplacer des événements vers ou depuis ce calendrier."

#. Description of the 'May Write Own' (Check) field in DocType 'Calendar'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar/calendar.json
msgid ""
"The user may create, modify or destroy an event on this calendar if either "
"they are the owner of the event or the event has no owner."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur peut créer, modifier ou supprimer un événement de ce "
"calendrier s'il en est le propriétaire ou si l'événement n'a pas de "
"propriétaire."

#. Description of the 'May Delete' (Check) field in DocType 'Address Book'
#: suite/mail/doctype/address_book/address_book.json
msgid "The user may delete the Address Book itself."
msgstr "L'utilisateur peut supprimer le carnet d'adresses lui-même."

#. Description of the 'May Delete' (Check) field in DocType 'Mailbox'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mailbox/mailbox.json
msgid "The user may delete the Mailbox itself."
msgstr "L'utilisateur peut supprimer la boîte aux lettres elle-même."

#. Description of the 'May Delete' (Check) field in DocType 'Calendar'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar/calendar.json
msgid "The user may delete the calendar itself."
msgstr "L'utilisateur peut supprimer le calendrier lui-même."

#. Description of the 'May Read' (Check) field in DocType 'Address Book'
#: suite/mail/doctype/address_book/address_book.json
msgid "The user may fetch the Contact Cards in this Address Book."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur peut récupérer les fiches de contact de ce carnet d'adresses."

#. Description of the 'May Read Items' (Check) field in DocType 'Calendar'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar/calendar.json
msgid "The user may fetch the events in this calendar."
msgstr "L'utilisateur peut récupérer les événements de ce calendrier."

#. Description of the 'May Update Private' (Check) field in DocType 'Calendar'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar/calendar.json
msgid "The user may modify per-user properties on all events in the calendar."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur peut modifier les propriétés propres à l'utilisateur sur tous "
"les événements du calendrier."

#. Description of the 'May Admin' (Check) field in DocType 'Address Book'
#: suite/mail/doctype/address_book/address_book.json
msgid "The user may modify the \"shareWith\" property for this Address Book."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur peut modifier la propriété « shareWith » de ce carnet "
"d'adresses."

#. Description of the 'May Admin' (Check) field in DocType 'Calendar'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar/calendar.json
msgid "The user may modify the \"shareWith\" property for this calendar."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur peut modifier la propriété « shareWith » de ce calendrier."

#. Description of the 'May RSVP' (Check) field in DocType 'Calendar'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar/calendar.json
msgid ""
"The user may modify the properties of any Participant object that "
"corresponds to one of the user's Participant Identity objects in the "
"account."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur peut modifier les propriétés de tout objet Participant "
"correspondant à l'un des objets Identité de participant de l'utilisateur "
"dans le compte."

#. Description of the 'May Read Free Busy' (Check) field in DocType 'Calendar'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar/calendar.json
msgid ""
"The user may read the free-busy information for this calendar as part of a "
"call to `Principal/getAvailability`."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur peut lire les informations de disponibilité de ce calendrier "
"dans le cadre d'un appel à `Principal/getAvailability`."

#. Description of the 'May Remove Items' (Check) field in DocType 'Mailbox'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mailbox/mailbox.json
msgid ""
"The user may remove mail from this Mailbox (by either changing the Mailboxes"
" of an Email or destroying the Email)."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur peut retirer du courrier de cette boîte aux lettres (en "
"modifiant les boîtes aux lettres d'un e-mail ou en supprimant l'e-mail)."

#. Description of the 'May Rename' (Check) field in DocType 'Mailbox'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mailbox/mailbox.json
msgid "The user may rename the Mailbox or make it a child of another Mailbox."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur peut renommer la boîte aux lettres ou en faire un enfant d'une"
" autre boîte aux lettres."

#. Description of the 'May Read Items' (Check) field in DocType 'Mailbox'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mailbox/mailbox.json
msgid ""
"The user may use this Mailbox as part of a filter in an `Email/query` call, "
"and the Mailbox may be included in the mailboxIds property of Email objects."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur peut utiliser cette boîte aux lettres dans un filtre lors d'un"
" appel `Email/query`, et la boîte aux lettres peut être incluse dans la "
"propriété mailboxIds des objets e-mail."

#. Description of the 'User' (Link) field in DocType 'Push Subscription'
#: suite/mail/doctype/push_subscription/push_subscription.json
msgid "The user this push subscription belongs to."
msgstr "L'utilisateur auquel appartient cet abonnement push."

#. Description of the 'User' (Link) field in DocType 'User Settings'
#: suite/mail/doctype/user_settings/user_settings.json
msgid "The user this settings belongs to."
msgstr "L'utilisateur auquel appartiennent ces paramètres."

#. Description of the 'User' (Link) field in DocType 'Vacation Response'
#: suite/mail/doctype/vacation_response/vacation_response.json
msgid "The user this vacation response belongs to."
msgstr "L'utilisateur auquel appartient cette réponse d'absence."

#. Description of the 'User' (Link) field in DocType 'Calendar Exchange'
#. Description of the 'User' (Link) field in DocType 'Mail Exchange'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar_exchange/calendar_exchange.json
#: suite/mail/doctype/mail_exchange/mail_exchange.json
msgid ""
"The user whose JMAP credentials are used to authenticate the import/export."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur dont les identifiants JMAP sont utilisés pour authentifier "
"l'import/export."

#. Description of the 'User' (Link) field in DocType 'Mail Queue'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mail_queue/mail_queue.json
msgid "The user whose JMAP credentials are used to send this message."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur dont les identifiants JMAP sont utilisés pour envoyer ce "
"message."

#. Description of the 'Name' (Data) field in DocType 'Address Book'
#: suite/mail/doctype/address_book/address_book.json
msgid "The user-visible name of the Address Book."
msgstr "Le nom visible par l'utilisateur du carnet d'adresses."

#. Description of the 'Name' (Data) field in DocType 'Calendar'
#: suite/mail/doctype/calendar/calendar.json
msgid "The user-visible name of the calendar."
msgstr "Le nom visible par l'utilisateur du calendrier."

#. Description of the 'Warn Limit' (Int) field in DocType 'Quota'
#: suite/mail/doctype/quota/quota.json
msgid "The warn limit set by this quota object."
msgstr "La limite d'avertissement définie par cet objet de quota."

