"Whether either (any) or both (all) of the conditions above must match. Only "
"relevant when both conditions are set."
msgstr ""
"Indique si l'une (any) ou la totalité (all) des conditions ci-dessus doit "
"être satisfaite. Pertinent uniquement lorsque les deux conditions sont "
"définies."

#. Description of the 'Is Readonly' (Check) field in DocType 'JMAP Account'
#: suite/mail/doctype/jmap_account/jmap_account.json
