#. Description of the 'Is Personal' (Check) field in DocType 'JMAP Account'
#: suite/mail/doctype/jmap_account/jmap_account.json
msgid ""
"Whether this is the user's personal account (as opposed to a shared or "
"delegated account), mirrored from the JMAP session's isPersonal flag."
msgstr ""
"Indique s'il s'agit du compte personnel de l'utilisateur (par opposition à "
"un compte partagé ou délégué), reflété depuis l'indicateur isPersonal de la "
"session JMAP."

#. Description of the 'Fail On Timeout' (Check) field in DocType 'Mail Cluster
